# `docs/trace.md` is the traceability matrix of the release context in `.req/variants` (line 1), the same
# artefact `req trace` prints; `req check` judges it with `req trace --check` (ADR 0018, amended 2026-11-10):
#
#   cargo run -q -- trace --out docs/trace.md corpus_set=parity_and_adversarial set=direction_gold_structural deployment_mode=air_gapped field=value
docs/trace.md
